    "detailed_description": "Apano SYN Fighter is a action game in the style of the 80s. Face countless waves of aliens, defeat them, and fight your way through each level to the final boss. The game is suitable for absolute beginners to virtuoso combat pilots. A gamepad is the only requirement, and it's even more fun if you invite one to three friends to join you in destroying the alien waves. #action #multiplayer #retro #arcade #shooter #scifi<br><br>The demo of Apano SYN Fighter is free to play and is intended to bridge the waiting time until the full version is released. We have unlocked two levels \u2013 have fun trying it out!<br><br><strong>Multiplayer Coop</strong><br>\u200bAt any time, a new player can connect a gamepad and join you in co-op mode. The alien fleet will be stronger, but you two are an unbeatable team anyway, right?\u00a0In the full version, you can also add computer-controlled coop buddies by pressing the two fire buttons and the A button. Up to five coop buddies are allowed. You can also start with a specific number of co-ops.",
