    "short_description": "Is there a gamepad lying around somewhere?!! Ready to play some real shooter games again? Grab the controller and become an APANO SYN PILOT to face the alien invasion. Connect up to four controllers and shoot until you drop. 100% survival chance on &quot;Easy&quot;, low on &quot;Impossible&quot;.",
